<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 150 million mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 150 million mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Trinkaus and Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     *4.30     MATURITY   *18.SEP.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE  S-18.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	LISTING    HANNOVER  DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.10	SELL CONC  1.25	GOV LAW     GERMAN</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 18.SEP.97, THEN 5.50 PCT IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		PFANDBRIEF SERIES 315</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
